&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:TreasurySharesEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:ClassesOfSharesEtcTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">【株式の種類等】　該当事項はありません。</jpcrp_cor:ClassesOfSharesEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
